**Two judgement calls on scope**
- **11/01 catches:** the normal window for this run is 11/02–11/03, so 11/01 is strictly outside it. I added them because none were in the data yet and most were posted after the last run. The reason is recorded in the run log.
- **下田:** 三昭丸 (下田) caught only キンメ, a fish not on the target list, so I left it out. That means I didn't have to decide whether 下田 counts as one of the three bays. It will come up again if a 下田 boat reports a target fish.

**Not added**
- Catches from outside the three bays.
- Non-target species: キハダ, コウイカ, ハゼ, クロムツ.
- Catches already in the data.
